{title: (Ghost) Riders In the Sky}
{artist: Stan Jones (popularized by Johnny Cash)}
{key: Am}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Verse 1}
An [Am]old cowpoke went ridin' out
One [C]dark and windy day
U[Am]pon a ridge he rested
As he went along his way.
When all at once a mighty herd
Of red-eyed cows he saw
A-[F]plowin' thru the ragged skies,
And [Am]up a cloudy draw.

{comment: Chorus}
Yip-pi-i-[C]o
Yip-pi-i-[Am]a,
[F]Ghost Riders in the [Am]Sky.


